          "name": "index.html",
          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n  <head>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    \n    <!-- Title -->\n    <h1>Guardians of the Green: The Power of Environmental Conservation</h1>\n    \n    <!-- informational paragraph -->\n    <div class=\"info\">\n      <p>In a world where the balance of nature hangs by a thread, the power of environmental conservation becomes more crucial than ever. Through the preservation of natural habitats, the reduction of pollution, and the adoption of sustainable practices, we hold the key to a greener, healthier planet. Environmental conservation isn't just about saving trees or animals; it's about ensuring a livable world for future generations. From the deep blue oceans to the sprawling urban greenspaces, every effort in conservation plays a vital role in our planet's ecosystem.</p> \n      <img src=\"nature.png\" alt=\"nature scene\">\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"learn\">\n      <img src=\"helping.png\" alt=\"helping with the conservation effort\">\n      <p>Discover how you can contribute to global conservation efforts and make a difference. <a href=\"https://www.amnh.org/research/center-for-biodiversity-conservation/resources-and-publications/what-you-can-do\">Click here</a> to learn about what you can do!</p>\n\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"citation\">\n      <p>All images created by chatGPT<br>CC0 1.0</p>\n    </div>\n\n\n\n\n\n  </body>\n</html>",
          "active": false,
          "folderId": "0"
        },
        "2": {
          "id": "2",
          "name": "style.css",
          "language": "css",
          "contents": "/* FIND AND FIX THE BUGS FOR THE ANCHOR TAG STATES */\n\na:active {\n  color:forestgreen;\n  background-color: yellow;\n  font-size: 26px;\n}\n\na:link {\n  color:#a200ff;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  font-style: italic;\n}\n\na:hover {\n  color: #e7ff07;\n  background-color: #a12fff;\n  font-size: 24px;\n  text-decoration-style: wavy;\n  border-radius: 7px;\n}\n\na:visited {\n  color: crimson;\n  font-size: 18px;\n}\n\n\nbody {\n  background-color: #d9ffd9;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-family: Arial;\n  font-size: 36px;\n  text-align: center;\n}\n\np {\n  font-family: Arial;\n  font-size: 18px;\n}\n\ndiv {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: center;\n  align-items: center;\n}\n\nimg {\n  border-style: solid;\n  border-radius: 15px;\n  width: 300px;\n  margin: 15px;\n}\n\n.citation {\n  height: 300px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: flex-end;\n}\n\n.citation > p {\n  text-align: center;\n  font-style: italic;\n  font-size: 10px;\n}",
